# Lip sync: Xardas (the nearest npc in the default save) says a voiced line of the game to the hero,
# the camera close to his face. First with lip sync, then the same line with the old talk loop.
cheat god
view clean 30
watch nearest
freeze nearest       # he leaves his bookstand and stands still
wait 500
place 150 0          # the hero in front of him: he looks at the camera's side
cam face 36 15 1
wait 800
rec quiet
wait 1000
lips on
speak nearest DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_14_00
rec lips
wait 9500
stop
wait 1500
lips off
speak nearest DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_14_00
rec loop
wait 9500
stop
lips on
